---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy - Student Data Protection";
const description = "All Cut Off privacy policy: no registration required, client-side calculations, and zero personal marks stored or transmitted.";
const keywords = "All Cut Off privacy policy, no data collection, client-side calculator, Google AdSense policy";
const lastUpdated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);

const extraSchema = [
  {
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Privacy Policy',
    url: `${new URL('/privacy', 'https://allcutoff.com').href}`,
    description,
    inLanguage: 'en-IN',
    isPartOf: { '@id': 'https://allcutoff.com/#website' }
  }
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords} extraSchema={extraSchema}>
  <section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-blue-600">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-slate-900">Privacy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <span class="mt-6 block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">STUDENT PRIVACY</span>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Privacy &amp; Data Protection
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
        Safe, anonymous, and client-side calculations. Last updated: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdated}</time>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16" aria-labelledby="privacy-content-heading">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6 px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 id="privacy-content-heading" class="sr-only">Privacy policy details</h2>
      <div class="hairline-card space-y-4 p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">1. Zero Mark Retention (Client-Side Math)</h3>
        <p>
          All cutoff calculations happen entirely inside your web browser using JavaScript. The subject marks or entrance exam scores you enter are never transmitted to our servers or stored in any database. There is no account, no submission step, and no server-side calculation endpoint.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">2. No Personal Data or Marks Transmitted</h3>
        <p>
          We do not ask for, receive, or store your name, phone number, roll number, email address, or school and college details. Because every score is computed locally, no personal data or marks ever leave your device when you use a calculator. Clearing your browser tab removes all traces of your session.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">3. No Account or Registration Required</h3>
        <p>
          You do not need to provide any identifying information to access the All Cut Off cutoff calculators. The service is free and open to everyone.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">4. Advertising</h3>
        <p>
          This site may display advertising provided by Google AdSense. We do not operate third-party ad trackers that store or sell personal data beyond Google's own certified ad partner policies. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalised advertising in your Google Ads Settings, or visit <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-700">Google Ads Settings</a>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">5. Analytics &amp; Server Logs</h3>
        <p>
          We may use lightweight, privacy-respecting analytics to track aggregate page view metrics, such as which calculators are most popular, in order to improve site performance and reliability. These reports are not linked to any individual student and never include the marks or scores you enter.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">6. External Links</h3>
        <p>
          Pages here link to official government and university websites for verification. Those sites are governed by their own privacy policies, which we do not control. Always confirm admission rules on the official conducting authority website.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">7. Children's Privacy</h3>
        <p>
          All Cut Off is intended for students of Class 12 and above. Because we never collect personal data from any user, including minors, there is no student information for us to disclose, sell, or share.
        </p>

        <h3 class="pt-2 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">8. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>
          Any future change to this policy will be published on this page with an updated "last updated" date. See also the <a href="/disclaimer" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-700">Official Disclaimer</a> and the <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-blue-700">contact page</a> for questions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>